 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Lord, you have been our dwelling place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through every age and year",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the mountains came to birth",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You are God, and you are here",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You turn us back to dust again",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You say, Return, and so we go",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A thousand years are in your sight",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like yesterday, gone long ago",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At morning grass is fresh and green",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By evening it is dry and gone",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So teach us, Lord, to count our days",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And give us hearts of wisdom",
